  "rationale": "The plant automata G1 and G2 model the robot's perception (obstacle sensing) and motion capabilities, respectively. The specification automata E1 and E2 bind perception outcomes to safe, progress-oriented actions, enforce conservative but efficient obstacle recovery, and ensure the robot spends most time exploring forward or via random_walk. Recovery actions are brief and escalate only if repeated blockages occur. All transitions are deterministic, and no forbidden event or state is used.",
